{%- comment -%}Financing page content ported from the headless Financing.tsx.{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="dls-page">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <div class="dls-container" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
    <div class="dls-eyebrow dls-eyebrow--center">Flexible Financing</div>
    <h1 class="dls-h1">Own It Now. <span class="text-gradient-gold">Pay Over Time.</span></h1>
    <p class="dls-muted" style="max-width: 44rem; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 1rem;">Split your purchase into manageable payments with Shop Pay Installments, powered by Affirm. Smaller orders can be paid in 4 interest-free installments; larger collection pieces can be spread across monthly plans. You&rsquo;ll see your exact schedule &mdash; and any interest &mdash; upfront at checkout, before you commit. Checking your options takes under a minute and won&rsquo;t affect your credit score.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Why collectors finance -->
  <div class="dls-container" style="margin-bottom: 4rem;">
    <h2 class="dls-h2" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">Why Serious Collectors Finance</h2>
    <div class="dls-grid-3">
      <div class="dls-card">
        <p class="dls-gold" style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">Build Now, Cash Later</p>
        <p class="dls-muted" style="margin: 0;">Expand your collection today without depleting capital. Keep investments working while securing your pieces.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dls-card">
        <p class="dls-gold" style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">Zero Interest, Full Control</p>
        <p class="dls-muted" style="margin: 0;">0% APR on approved purchases. No hidden fees, no prepayment penalties. Pay early anytime.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dls-card">
        <p class="dls-gold" style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">Instant Approval, Same-Day Ship</p>
        <p class="dls-muted" style="margin: 0;">Real-time credit decision at checkout. Approved orders ship on normal schedule with expert concierge support.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Two ways to pay -->
  <div class="dls-container" style="margin-bottom: 4rem;">
    <h2 class="dls-h2" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Two Ways to Pay in Installments</h2>
    <p class="dls-muted" style="text-align: center; max-width: 40rem; margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;">At checkout, Shop Pay automatically shows the plans your order qualifies for. Choose the one that fits your budget.</p>
    <div class="dls-grid-2">
      <div class="dls-card dls-card--gold" style="padding: 2rem;">
        <p class="dls-gold" style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin: 0 0 0.5rem;">Option 1</p>
        <h3 style="color: white; font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">Pay in 4 &mdash; Interest-Free</h3>
        <p class="dls-muted" style="margin: 0 0 1rem;">Split the total into <strong style="color: var(--cream-100);">4 equal payments</strong>, one every two weeks, over roughly six weeks. <strong style="color: var(--cream-100);">0% interest and no fees</strong> when you pay on schedule.</p>
        <p class="dls-muted" style="font-size: 0.8rem; margin: 0;">Best for accessories and desktop or travel humidors. Typically available on eligible orders up to about $3,000.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dls-card dls-card--gold" style="padding: 2rem;">
        <p class="dls-gold" style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin: 0 0 0.5rem;">Option 2</p>
        <h3 style="color: white; font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">Monthly Financing</h3>
        <p class="dls-muted" style="margin: 0 0 1rem;">Spread larger purchases across <strong style="color: var(--cream-100);">monthly payments</strong> &mdash; commonly 3, 6, or 12 months. Your rate (from 0% APR for qualified buyers, up to a maximum of 36% APR) and full payment schedule are shown <strong style="color: var(--cream-100);">before you confirm</strong>.</p>
        <p class="dls-muted" style="font-size: 0.8rem; margin: 0;">Best for cabinet, electronic, and walk-in humidor builds. Available on eligible orders up to $17,500+.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="dls-muted" style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-align: center; margin: 1.5rem auto 0; max-width: 44rem; opacity: 0.75;">Shop Pay Installments is a lending program provided by Affirm. Eligibility, plan availability, and interest rate are decided in real time using a soft credit check that does not affect your credit score. There are never hidden fees &mdash; the exact amount and schedule you see at checkout is what you pay.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- How it works -->
  <div class="dls-container dls-container--wide" style="margin-bottom: 4rem;">
    <h2 class="dls-h2" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">How It Works</h2>
    <div class="dls-grid-4">
      <div class="dls-card">
        <div class="dls-step-num" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">1</div>
        <h3 style="color: white; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">Add to Cart &amp; Check Out</h3>
        <p class="dls-muted" style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.85rem;">Shop as usual. At our secure Shopify checkout, choose "Shop Pay &middot; Pay in installments" as your payment method.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dls-card">
        <div class="dls-step-num" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">2</div>
        <h3 style="color: white; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">Get a Real-Time Decision</h3>
        <p class="dls-muted" style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.85rem;">Enter a few basic details for an instant eligibility check. Checking your eligibility will not affect your credit score.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dls-card">
        <div class="dls-step-num" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">3</div>
        <h3 style="color: white; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">Choose Your Plan</h3>
        <p class="dls-muted" style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.85rem;">Pick Pay-in-4 (interest-free, every two weeks) or a monthly plan for larger orders. Your schedule and any interest are shown before you confirm.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dls-card">
        <div class="dls-step-num" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">4</div>
        <h3 style="color: white; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">Enjoy Your Humidor Now</h3>
        <p class="dls-muted" style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.85rem;">Your order ships on the normal schedule — expert concierge support included on cabinet and electronic humidors.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Payment examples -->
  <div class="dls-container" style="margin-bottom: 4rem;">
    <div class="dls-card dls-card--gold" style="padding: 2.5rem;">
      <h2 class="dls-h2" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Real-World Payment Examples</h2>
      <p class="dls-muted" style="text-align: center; margin: 0 0 2.5rem;">How the two plans look at different collection levels</p>
      <div class="dls-grid-3">
        <div class="dls-card" style="background: var(--charcoal-950); text-align: center;">
          <p class="dls-gold" style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin: 0 0 0.5rem;">Pay in 4 &middot; Interest-Free</p>
          <p style="color: white; font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 0 0 1rem;">$2,352</p>
          <p style="color: var(--gold-300); font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0;">$588<span class="dls-muted" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.85rem;"> &times; 4</span></p>
          <p class="dls-muted" style="font-size: 0.75rem; margin: 0.75rem 0 0;">One payment every 2 weeks &middot; 0% interest. Ideal for a desktop or travel humidor.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="dls-card" style="background: var(--charcoal-950); text-align: center; border-color: rgba(201, 138, 16, 0.4);">
          <p class="dls-gold" style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin: 0 0 0.5rem;">Monthly &middot; 12-Month Plan</p>
          <p style="color: white; font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 0 0 1rem;">$4,752</p>
          <p style="color: var(--gold-300); font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0;">from $396<span class="dls-muted" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.85rem;">/mo</span></p>
          <p class="dls-muted" style="font-size: 0.75rem; margin: 0.75rem 0 0;">Over 12 months at 0% APR for qualified buyers. Cabinet &amp; electronic humidors.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="dls-card" style="background: var(--charcoal-950); text-align: center;">
          <p class="dls-gold" style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin: 0 0 0.5rem;">Monthly &middot; 12-Month Plan</p>
          <p style="color: white; font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 0 0 1rem;">$6,387</p>
          <p style="color: var(--gold-300); font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0;">from $532<span class="dls-muted" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.85rem;">/mo</span></p>
          <p class="dls-muted" style="font-size: 0.75rem; margin: 0.75rem 0 0;">Over 12 months at 0% APR for qualified buyers. Walk-in sanctuaries &amp; collection builds.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="dls-muted" style="font-size: 0.7rem; text-align: center; margin: 1.5rem 0 0; opacity: 0.7;">Examples are illustrative and assume on-time payment. Pay-in-4 is always 0% interest; monthly plans range from 0% APR for qualified buyers up to a maximum of 36% APR. Plan availability, term length, and your exact rate are determined by Affirm at checkout after a soft credit check that does not affect your credit score &mdash; you always see the full schedule before you commit.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Testimonial -->
  <div class="dls-container dls-container--narrow" style="margin-bottom: 4rem;">
    <div class="dls-card dls-card--gold" style="text-align: center; font-style: italic; padding: 2.5rem;">
      <p class="dls-muted" style="font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 0 0 1.5rem;">"I financed my walk-in build so I could complete the project now and keep my cash reserves intact. The approval was instant, and the monthly payments fit perfectly into my budget. Best part? Zero interest, zero surprises."</p>
      <p class="dls-gold" style="font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; margin: 0;">Marcus T., Collector</p>
      <p class="dls-muted" style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-style: normal; margin: 0.25rem 0 0;">Walk-In Sanctuary, $6,200 financed</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <div class="dls-container dls-container--narrow" style="margin-bottom: 4rem;">
    <h2 class="dls-h2" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">Financing FAQ</h2>
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem;">
      {%- assign faq_qs = 'What payment methods do you accept?|How does Shop Pay installment payment work?|Do I need a Shop Pay account?|Is there interest or hidden fees?|Is Shop Pay financing available on all products?|Can I pay early with no penalty?' | split: '|' -%}
      {%- assign faq_as = 'We accept all major credit cards, debit cards, and Shop Pay. With Shop Pay Installments you can also split eligible orders into payments — interest-free with Pay-in-4, or across monthly plans for larger purchases.|At checkout you can choose between two plans: Pay-in-4 splits your total into 4 interest-free payments, one every two weeks; monthly financing spreads larger purchases over 3, 6, or 12 months. You pick the plan and see the full schedule — including any interest — before you confirm.|No account needed. Shop Pay Installments is offered right at checkout for eligible purchases, and you pay with any major credit or debit card.|Pay-in-4 is always 0% interest with no fees. Monthly plans may carry interest — from 0% APR for qualified buyers up to a maximum of 36% APR — and the exact rate is always shown upfront before you commit. There are never hidden fees.|Pay-in-4 is available on most eligible orders, including smaller accessories, while monthly financing covers larger purchases up to $17,500+. Your available plans appear automatically at checkout.|Yes. You can pay off your installments early at any time without penalty or additional fees.' | split: '|' -%}
      {%- for q in faq_qs -%}
        <details class="dls-card" style="padding: 0;">
          <summary style="padding: 1rem 1.25rem; cursor: pointer; color: var(--cream-100); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500;">{{ q }}</summary>
          <p class="dls-muted" style="padding: 0 1.25rem 1rem; margin: 0;">{{ faq_as[forloop.index0] }}</p>
        </details>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <div class="dls-container dls-container--narrow" style="text-align: center;">
    <h2 class="dls-h2" style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Questions About Financing?</h2>
    <p class="dls-muted" style="margin: 0 0 1.5rem;">Our specialists are happy to walk you through payment options before you order. Call <a href="tel:8884319214" class="dls-gold">(888) 431-9214</a> or email <a href="mailto:support@dunnluxuryselections.com" class="dls-gold">support@dunnluxuryselections.com</a>.</p>
    <a href="/collections/all" class="btn btn-primary">Browse Collections</a>
    <p class="dls-muted" style="font-size: 0.75rem; margin-top: 1rem;">Mon&ndash;Fri, 9:00 AM &ndash; 6:00 PM CST</p>
  </div>
</div>

